			<en>Welcome to this stunning and spacious townhouse, ideally situated within a modern gated development, offering a fantastic range of amenities including a large communal swimming pool. As you step through the front door, you're greeted by an inviting entrance hall that leads seamlessly into the expansive open-plan living and dining room. This bright and airy space is perfect for both family gatherings and relaxed entertaining, with large windows that bathe the room in natural light. The living area opens up to a generous enclosed balcony, providing far-reaching views over the peaceful countryside the ideal spot to unwind and enjoy the surroundings. On this floor, youll also find a stylish and well-equipped kitchen breakfast room, fitted with high-end units and fully integrated appliances. This space offers ample room for family meals or casual dining. A luxurious ground-floor shower room is also conveniently located, offering contemporary fittings and fixtures. Stairs lead up to a galleried landing that connects to all three of the generously sized double bedrooms. Each bedroom is fitted with built-in wardrobes featuring courtesy lighting for a touch of luxury. Bedrooms two and three also enjoy access to an interconnecting balcony that overlooks the communal swimming pool, making it a wonderful space to relax or enjoy the views. The large well appointed family bathroom is also located on this floor. On the lower level, the property boasts a large garage with a utility area that is fully plumbed and equipped with an electric garage door for ease of access. Additionally, there's a versatile multi-purpose room that could be transformed into a home theatre, craft room, or any other space to suit your needs. A separate soundproof studio with its own full en suite shower room provides an ideal option for a fourth bedroom or private office. This fantastic family home also benefits from being fully double glazed, with air conditioning throughout for comfort in all seasons. A cosy wood burner in the living area adds an extra touch of warmth and charm. Viewings are highly recommended to truly appreciate the spaciousness, flexibility, and the exceptional quality this property has to offer. This is a home that will easily meet the needs of a growing family while providing a tranquil retreat from the hustle and bustle of everyday life. 1 Real Estate, part of the Property Cloud Group, is a leading international estate agent in the Costa Blanca, with over 50 years combined experience in Spanish property sales and over 40 dedicated staff. We are committed to providing a transparent, first-class service to all our clients, whether buyers or sellers. From the moment you first contact us, you'll notice the exceptional level of care and expertise we deliver as standard. At 1 Real Estate, we focus exclusively on properties directly listed with us, allowing us to build strong relationships with our vendors, understand their homes, and have in-depth knowledge of the areas we serve. With our extensive portfolio of properties, we are confident we can find the perfect match for your requirements. Make an enquiry today and discover why we stand out as the agent of choice for buyers and sellers in the Costa Blanca. </en>
			<es>Bienvenido a esta impresionante y espaciosa casa adosada, idealmente situada dentro de una moderna urbanización cerrada, que ofrece una fantástica gama de comodidades, incluida una gran piscina comunitaria. Al cruzar la puerta principal, lo recibe un acogedor hall de entrada que conduce sin problemas a la amplia sala de estar y comedor de planta abierta. Este espacio amplio y luminoso es perfecto tanto para reuniones familiares como para entretenimiento relajado, con grandes ventanales que bañan la habitación con luz natural. La sala de estar se abre a un generoso balcón cerrado, que ofrece vistas de gran alcance sobre el tranquilo campo, el lugar ideal para relajarse y disfrutar de los alrededores. En esta planta, también encontrará una elegante y bien equipada sala de desayunos con cocina, equipada con muebles de alta gama y electrodomésticos totalmente integrados. Este espacio ofrece un amplio espacio para comidas familiares o cenas informales. Un lujoso cuarto de baño con ducha en la planta baja también está convenientemente ubicado, ofreciendo accesorios y accesorios contemporáneos. Las escaleras conducen a un rellano con galerías que conecta con las tres habitaciones dobles de generosas dimensiones. Cada dormitorio está equipado con armarios empotrados con iluminación de cortesía para darle un toque de lujo. Los dormitorios dos y tres también disfrutan de acceso a un balcón interconectado que da a la piscina comunitaria, lo que lo convierte en un espacio maravilloso para relajarse o disfrutar de las vistas. El gran baño familiar bien equipado también se encuentra en este piso. En el nivel inferior, la propiedad cuenta con un gran garaje con un lavadero que está completamente conectado y equipado con una puerta de garaje eléctrica para facilitar el acceso. Además, hay una sala versátil de usos múltiples que podría transformarse en un cine en casa, una sala de manualidades o cualquier otro espacio que se adapte a sus necesidades. Un estudio independiente 