			<en>Welcome to this stunning, brand new ground floor apartment, purpose-built and completed in 2025, located in the sought-after area of Finestrat on the beautiful Costa Blanca. Designed and furnished by professional interior designers to an exceptional standard, this turnkey property offers luxury living at its finest. As you step inside, you are greeted by a spacious open-plan living area that blends effortlessly into a high-specification kitchen, complete with fully integrated high-end appliances ideal for modern living and entertaining. The living space extends out through large glass doors to a generously sized private west-facing terrace, offering far-reaching views and the perfect spot for enjoying the Mediterranean sunsets. The apartment features two large double bedrooms, each with its luxurious en-suite bathroom, finished with contemporary fixtures and elegant tiling. Additional features include: Private parking directly outside the property Fully double glazed with electric blinds Video entry phone system Hot and cold ducted air conditioning Integrated alarm system for peace of mind Access to a beautifully maintained communal swimming pool and a private residents gym Ideally suited as a permanent residence, holiday retreat or investment opportunity, this property is offered fully furnished and ready to move into. Viewings are highly recommended to truly appreciate the quality, design, and location of this exceptional apartment. 1 Real Estate, part of the Property Cloud Group, is a leading international estate agent in the Costa Blanca, with over 50 years combined experience in Spanish property sales and over 40 dedicated staff. We are committed to providing a transparent, first-class service to all our clients, whether buyers or sellers. From the moment you first contact us, you'll notice the exceptional level of care and expertise we deliver as standard. At 1 Real Estate, we focus exclusively on properties directly listed with us, allowing us to build