e remaining just a short distance from the towns amenities. Perfect for those seeking serenity without sacrificing proximity to urban life. Viewings are recommended. 1 Real Estate, part of the Property Cloud Group, is a leading international estate agent in the Costa Blanca, with over 50 years combined experience in Spanish property sales and over 40 dedicated staff. We are committed to providing a transparent, first-class service to all our clients, whether buyers or sellers. From the moment you first contact us, you'll notice the exceptional level of care and expertise we deliver as standard. At 1 Real Estate, we focus exclusively on properties directly listed with us, allowing us to build strong relationships with our vendors, understand their homes, and have in-depth knowledge of the areas we serve. With our extensive portfolio of properties, we are confident we can find the perfect match for your requirements. Make an enquiry today and discover why we stand out as the agent of choice for buyers and sellers in the Costa Blanca.</en>
