			<pt/>
			<en>Welcome to this exceptional detached villa, beautifully positioned on a generous corner plot within the highly sought-after residential community of Benarrosa Gardens. Nestled in the heart of Alcalalí on the stunning Costa Blanca, this immaculate home combines modern luxury with Mediterranean charm, offering a wonderful lifestyle both indoors and out. Approaching the property, you are greeted by beautifully maintained gardens and the choice of either a pedestrian entrance or a private driveway providing secure off-road parking. The villa immediately impresses with its attractive presentation and sense of privacy. Stepping inside, a welcoming entrance hall leads through to the heart of the home a spacious and light-filled lounge and dining room. This inviting living space features a charming fireplace with an inset wood-burning stove, creating a warm and cosy focal point for the cooler months. The open-plan layout flows effortlessly into the recently refitted luxury kitchen, beautifully appointed with composite work surfaces, high-quality integrated appliances, and contemporary cabinetry, making it as practical as it is stylish. From the main living area, doors open onto a substantial covered naya, providing the perfect setting for outdoor dining, entertaining, or simply relaxing while enjoying views across the landscaped gardens, surrounding countryside, and the magnificent mountain backdrop. An inner hallway leads to the villa's two generously proportioned double bedrooms, each benefiting from its own beautifully refitted luxury shower room, offering both comfort and privacy for owners and guests alike. Outside, the property truly comes into its own. The extensive corner plot has been thoughtfully landscaped and is stocked with a variety of mature fruit trees. Fully enclosed by attractive dwarf walls with decorative wrought iron fencing, the gardens offer both security and low-maintenance enjoyment. A superb covered outdoor kitchen and barbecue area provides an ideal space for entertaining family and friends, with ample room for dining and social gatherings. Beyond, the impressive pool terrace centres around a heated swimming pool complete with a pool cover and outdoor shower, creating a private oasis for year-round enjoyment. Further enhancing the property's appeal is a large underbuild and workshop, offering excellent storage, hobby space, or potential for a variety of uses. The villa is equipped to a high specification throughout, including oil-fired central heating, air conditioning, ceiling fans, double-glazed windows with fitted mosquito screens, and a comprehensive solar energy system serving both the house and swimming pool. There is also provision for the future installation of an electric vehicle charging point. Presented in outstanding condition and offering a rare combination of quality, comfort, energy efficiency, and outdoor living, this superb villa represents an exceptional opportunity in one of the area's most desirable locations. Early viewing is strongly recommended to fully appreciate everything this remarkable home has to offer. 1 Real Estate, part of the Property Cloud Group, is a leading international estate agent in the Costa Blanca, with over 50 years combined experience in Spanish property sales and over 40 dedicated staff. We are committed to providing a transparent, first-class service to all our clients, whether buyers or sellers. From the moment you first contact us, you'll notice the exceptional level of care and expertise we deliver as standard. At 1 Real Estate, we focus exclusively on properties directly listed with us, allowing us to build strong relationships with our vendors, understand their homes, and have in-depth knowledge of the areas we serve. With our extensive portfolio of properties, we are confident we can find the perfect match for your requirements. Make an enquiry today and discover why we stand out as the agent of choice for buyers and sellers in the Costa Blanca.</en>
